          "description": "Controlled capture v1: each staleAttempts storedBefore is an independent reset/fork from newerStored; storedAfter proves preservation. Current clearance and duplicate retry are a separate positive branch. Time is checked within each branch, not chronologically across distinct controls. Superseded-lease and stale-checkpoint branches independently isolate only the named fence with all other fences current and an unexpired lease."
